  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/3abccb155d83721db838a3203f4f1a8a13ab765be1913592e30d5b9aad004ff1.png] \n\nGiven equation → 10 ÷ 5 + 144 × 12 + 13 − 45 × 9 + 12 = ?\n\nAfter '+' and '−' are interchanged and also '×' and '÷' are interchanged then, we get\n\n→ **10 × 5 - 144 ÷ 12 - 13 +**** 45 ÷ 9 - 12 = ?**\n\n10 × 5 - __**144 ÷ 12**__ - 13 + __**45 ÷ 9**__ - 12 = ?\n\n__**10 × 5**__ - 12 - 13 + 5 - 12 = ?\n\n__**50**__ - 12 - 13 __**+ 5**__ - 12 = ?\n\n__**55 - 12 - 13 - 12**__ = ?\n\n**18**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"18\".**",
